        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This is a secondary tidy-up that keeps your jar light. Only how the gems are stored and shown is compressed: the time of every gem and all %@ of mass are kept 100%%. Time cores grow from mass, not from counts. There's no need to rush to the next one."
